Version 2.0.4
- Fix terminal width detection using wrong file descriptor (stdin → stdout)
- Fix IFNDR (ill-formed, no diagnostic required) in from_chars fallback template
- Remove <experimental/type_traits> dependency; use std::void_t-based detection
- Remove custom string_view_base reimplementation; use std::string_view directly
- Consistent flag value handling: --verbose=true delegates to set_value like config files
- Avoid unsigned integer overflow in word wrapping cost calculation
- Initialize m_seen in option_base constructor
- Replace std::println/exit in compile-time error handler with throw for cleaner diagnostics

Version 2.0.3
- Fix include in cmake config file

Version 2.0.2
- Build as traditional as well as module library.

Version 2.0.1
- Fix name of fast_float in CPMFindPackage to FastFloat

Version 2.0.0
- Add support for global options added by a library
- Changed the config file parsing for flag options, an argument is now required
- Improved wrapping of config options, added support for std::ostream::width

